  "title": "Eliminating Checkout Abandonment in eCommerce",
  "summary": "Over the past decade, eCommerce has seen an unprecedented boom. With giants like Amazon and Walmart battling for dominance, and challengers such as Wish and Temu entering the fray, it’s clear that the 2010s and early 2020s have been defined by online retail. But as digital marketplaces expand, so too does the sophistication and scale of fraudulent activity targeting sellers, buyers, and platforms.",
